WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.583
(upbeat music)

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.522
- [Narrator] Every day at
five o'clock in the morning

00:00:31.522 --> 00:00:34.360
Khalida Nasreen takes off on
her motorbike to inoculate

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:36.450
Pakistani children against polio.

00:00:43.409 --> 00:00:45.410
- [Narrator] As a polio
supervisor, Khalida and her team

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:48.330
go door-to-door, often in
areas where various stigmas

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:51.060
keep people from trusting
healthcare workers.

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:54.110
It's a dangerous job, and
dozens of healthcare workers

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:56.580
have been attacked or
killed in recent years.

00:01:59.868 --> 00:02:02.118
(cheering)

